<main class="page">

  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    Unbound Healing Ministries is an ongoing exploration of healing,
    wonder, attention, and the extraordinary nature of ordinary experience.
  </p>

  <p>
    Through reflection, conversation, compassionate service,
    and shared inquiry, we invite deeper curiosity about what it means
    to be alive.
  </p>

  <p>
    We do not claim to possess answers.
    We remain fascinated by questions.
  </p>

  <p>
    Much of what appears here emerges from journals, conversations,
    observations, and ordinary moments that seemed worth sharing.
  </p>

  <p>
    The hope is not to tell anyone what to think.
    Perhaps only to encourage a closer look.
  </p>

  <div class="section-space"></div>

  <p>
    Created and maintained by Clint Noiseau.
  </p>

  <p>
    With gratitude for many conversations,
    including those with ChatGPT.
  </p>

  <p class="warm">(((accepted)))</p>
  <p class="warm">(((invited)))</p>

</main>

